# Binary formats that `* text=auto` guesses wrong.
#
# Git classified the submission PDFs as text and announced it would rewrite
# their line endings on checkout, which corrupts them. PNG and the rest are
# listed alongside so the same guess cannot be made about them later.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
